            "sid": "EZK 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wac pa Rwoth obino ran ka waco ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wod dhano, neni, ot pa Isiraili jowaco ni, menyirok m'ineno latero ndelo kweth, aka wac m'ituco hongo mere fodi bor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno wac rijo ni Rwoth Were waco ama: Wac paran je kilagalo kendo, wac je m'aluwo latundo i kare, Rwoth Were waco.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.28"
            ]
          }
